---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import TimeLineElement from "../components/cv/TimeLine.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Resume" sideBarActiveItemID="cv">
  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Profile</div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-10 text-justify">
    I am an undergraduate researcher at IISER Thiruvananthapuram pursuing a BS-MS in i2 Mathematics[cite: 1]. My academic and technical foundation lies at the intersection of Stochastic Processes, Optimization, and Reinforcement Learning[cite: 1]. I am deeply focused on bridging rigorous mathematical frameworks with corporate business applications, specifically leveraging my background for High-Frequency Trading (HFT) modeling, quantitative finance, and robust market-making strategies[cite: 1].
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Education</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container grid gap-4 mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="BS-MS in Mathematics (Major: i2 Mathematics)"
      subtitle="August 2023 to May 2028 at IISER Thiruvananthapuram, Kerala, India"
    >
      GPA: 7.21/10.0. Honors: PM Yasasvi Scholar for Academic Excellence (Awarded from 2nd Year)[cite: 1]. GATE 2026 (DA): AIR 3144[cite: 1]. Coursework includes Numerical Analysis, ODEs, Probability, Linear Algebra, and Optimization[cite: 1].
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Higher Secondary Education (Science)"
      subtitle="August 2020 to May 2022 at Gyan Deep Sr. Sec. Public School, Uttar Pradesh, India"
    >
      Percentage: 95.4%[cite: 1].
    </TimeLineElement>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Experience & Research</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Research Intern"
      subtitle="Summer 2026 at Wadhwani School of Data Science and AI (WSAI), IIT Madras"
    >
      Executed computational research on the project "Discerning ecological behaviour and interactions of minimal reactomes of the human gut." Modeled the human gut microbiome mathematically, bridging systems biology with large-scale computational optimization frameworks under the supervision of Prof. Karthik Raman[cite: 1].
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Reinforcement Learning for Market Making"
      subtitle="February 2026 to March 2026 (Independent Project)"
    >
      Engineered a Soft Actor-Critic (SAC) agent to optimize bid-ask spreads in a simulated Limit Order Book (LOB)[cite: 1]. Modeled inventory risk using asymmetric reward functions to manage stochastic price volatility[cite: 1]. Benchmarked performance against classical Avellaneda-Stoikov strategies, achieving superior risk-adjusted returns[cite: 1].
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Game Theory Reading Project"
      subtitle="December 2025 to January 2026 at IISER TVM"
    >
      Analyzed strategic decision-making and Nash equilibria in multi-agent competitive environments under the supervision of Prof. Sheetal[cite: 1]. Explored payoff matrices and mathematical modeling of strategic interactions in economic contexts[cite: 1].
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Classical-Quantum Hybrid Classifier"
      subtitle="October 2024 to November 2024 (Independent Project)"
    >
      Developed a novel hybrid protocol utilizing PCA and K-Means for reference centroid selection[cite: 1]. Implemented a UUt quantum circuit to measure state overlap probability for non-linear classification, optimizing decision rules for near-term quantum hardware[cite: 1].
    </TimeLineElement>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Certifications & Conferences</div>
  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
    <li>
      <a href="#" target="_blank"> Mastering Deep Learning | IIM Bangalore (SWAYAM) - Jan 2025</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="#" target="_blank"> Intl. Conference on Computational & Applied Math - Dec 2025</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="#" target="_blank"> AI & ML Workshops | Deloitte, WEKA, IIT Madras - 2024-2025</a>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Technical Skills</div>
  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc md:columns-5 columns-2 mx-6">
    <li>Python</li>
    <li>SQL</li>
    <li>R</li>
    <li>C++</li>
    <li>LaTeX</li>
    <li>PyTorch</li>
    <li>TensorFlow</li>
    <li>PennyLane</li>
    <li>Scikit-Learn</li>
    <li>Pandas</li>
    <li>NumPy</li>
    <li>Deep RL (SAC)</li>
    <li>Quantum ML</li>
    <li>Git / GitHub</li>
    <li>Jupyter / VS Code</li>
  </ul>
</BaseLayout>